abstract: >-
  BookWiz is a private writing studio for planning, drafting, revising,
  designing and exporting books. It combines local manuscript storage,
  optional connected writing models, Draft Flow continuation steering,
  story profiles, original cover directions and publishing tools.
keywords:
  - writing
  - manuscript
  - publishing
  - local-first
  - creative-writing
